# App portfolio face

The portfolio is a **one-page public face**, not a Portal action dashboard.

## Face contents

- Identity (avatar, name, **full** NEAR account id as handle, full bio)
- Connected visitor gestures under bio: **Stand · Endorse · Support** (quiet text + colored arrows; no pills)
- Signals (standing · solidarity · endorsements · reputation) — browse metrics
- Links
- Dock (connect / account / summon)

## Page drawer (Launch)

Owner-customizable scroll surface — **extension of the face**, not a second portfolio:

- Tall glass sheet (~95dvh) so a thin strip of mood face stays visible
- Compact header: **name** + one facts line (`N posts · N guilds · Joined Mon YYYY ›`) + jump chips; DAO roles / tags live in the Joined account-facts sheet
- **Joined** is clickable → slim account-facts sheet (Portal-style), not a second face card
- Account facts OnSocial: Joined · fused `Updated Mar 12 · Name · Banner` (omit when same day as Joined) · activity/roles/tags when present; NEAR: Network · Account · Created
- Drawer body is a **curated portfolio**: peek sections → See all; hide empty sections
- Jump chips live in **header chrome** under facts (not in the scroll body); scroll-spy active state; compact chips; mood tint on **active chip only**; smooth-scroll to sections
- Default order: posts → guilds → collectibles → links → badges
- One sheet-body scroller; overlay footer pill (**Stand · Endorse · Support**) absolutely on the panel (`height: auto`, not in flex flow); content scrolls under it; launcher hide on scroll down / reveal on scroll up or top; jump briefly tucks the pill; connect whisper when disconnected; hidden for self
- Support is **not** a drawer section — gestures only
- Dock arrows match Stand size (`0.55rem`), not the larger face signal clamp
- Face keeps link **icons**; drawer Links shows label + hostname / handle rows
- No avatar / `@id` / bio — face already owns those
- No reputation band names — score/rank stay on the face
- Mood-thread chrome + thin drag grip; sections scroll inside
- Hide zero counts

## Gesture row

| Control | Arrow hue | Behavior |
|---------|-----------|----------|
| **Stand** / Standing / Step back | `--signal-standing` | Inline toggle (ledger + dots; Step back on hover) |
| **Endorse** | `--signal-endorse` | Opens endorsements overlay (compose there) |
| **Support** | `--signal-reputation` | Opens dedicated Support glass sheet |

Even trio with · separators. Same control height as standing modal; **no border**; hover = soft bg wash.

## Before vs after connect

| State | Face |
|-------|------|
| Disconnected | Full face + dock connect only — **no** gesture row |
| Connected visitor | Same face + Stand · Endorse · Support under bio |
| Owner / self | No visitor gestures; when unclaimed target balance > 0: **gift · amount · Collect** in the same slot |

## Off-face depth

- **Standing lists** — signal taps → standing overlay
- **Endorsements** — endorse signal / face Endorse → endorsements overlay + compose sheet
- **Support** — face Support + drawer Stand · Support whisper → dedicated `ProfileSupportSheet` (amount + `trackTransaction`)
  - Form stack: amount → presets left / available right → outcome → CTA
  - Outcome line **live only** from `get_action_config` — never show hardcoded % fallback
  - Valid amount morphs same line to SOCIAL amounts (`0.99 to them · 0.01 protocol boost`)
  - While loading: `Loading split…`; on failure: soft error + Retry; Support gated until live + active
  - Say **protocol boost**, not treasury
  - **Received support (owner):** face Collect line (`PortfolioOwnerSupportCollect`) — gift icon + amount + Collect; claims shared `get_target_balance` pot (profile support, endorsement support, boost-post author share); `claim_target_balance` + `trackTransaction`; owner-only; hide when zero; not in account sheet

## Gesture sheet chrome (Support / Endorse compose)

One title beat — **not** a duplicate face-card strip:

- Fused title: signal-colored verb + person (`Support Voter 02`, `Endorse …`)
- Quiet `@` + **full account id** under the title (never strip `.near` / `.testnet`)
- Optional one-line whisper only when relationship state exists
- Close control top-right

Shared: `GestureSheetHeader` (`gesture-sheet-header.tsx`). Identity labels use `fallbackLabel` / raw `accountId` — full NEAR id.

## Do not

- Copy Portal’s bordered Support + Endorse + Stand pill cluster
- Show disabled action CTAs pre-connect
- Put the money Support **form** on the mood face or inline in the page drawer (sheet only)
- Open the page content drawer for face Support
- Use bordered pills on face gestures **or face tags**
- Put profile tags on the face — drawer only (quiet text, no pills)
- Re-introduce the person in the page drawer (no second avatar · name · handle card; no bio bridge)
- Stack avatar · name · handle **and** a bare verb title on gesture sheets when already on their face
- Open the page drawer as a full-bleed wipe — keep a mood-face peek